  "notes": [
    "BetterWB Bonus supplies JAZ0 40.1, JAZ2 1.0, JAZPC 1.0, ZIC 1.0 and ZIP 1.0. BestWB 1.3 supplies the exact CrossDOS CF0 variant with the 1.21 header.",
    "The six mountlists are shipped under Storage/DOSDrivers for manual activation. Workbench uses the device and unit tooltypes from the BCWB icons.",
    "The shared DOSDrivers drawers include OS and ViNCEd paths. The BCWB device and datatype overlay owns the replacement and companion icons."
